# Claude Code agent worktrees (transient; auto-created for isolated subagents)
.claude/worktrees/

# The auth service's database (server/, deploy/). Accounts and live session
# tokens — the one thing on a deployed box that is not rebuildable from this
# repo, and the last thing that should ever be committed. `.env` above already
# covers server/.env, which holds the mail API key.
/server/data/
*.db
*.db-wal
*.db-shm

# scripts/telemetry/battles.mjs --out dump. It was committed once, a megabyte of
# it, at the repo root — and then went stale, because the default invocation in
# its own usage line no longer reproduces the committed bytes. Anyone following
# that documented command overwrote it and got an unmergeable million-line diff.
# Same policy as the sprite atlas (see above) and the same reason: generated
# output masquerading as source drifts silently and nobody notices. The usage
# line now points at scripts/telemetry/out/, which the `out` rule above ignores.
/log.jsonl
problem.txt
.opencode/
opencode.json
